16 CONTROL MUTATIONS RUN, ALL KILLED. Two found real defects in this run''s own tests rather than in the code: (1) the must-NOT and its control both pinned warnings.counts to exact figures, so the rejection went red on every membership mutation and its own evidence was never tested — weakened to "the warnings fired at all" and the five mutations now separate cleanly; (2) "naming an epic narrows nothing else" passed under a mutation that filtered criteria by epic, because every fixture held ONE epic — a two-epic fixture now catches it.

